From 8880b9daf991283bd19391b73ee5479dc92ff0bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zhen Lei <thunder.leizhen@huawei.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Nov 2022 17:25:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 769/780] [Backport] sched: Add helper
 nr_context_switches_cpu()

mainline inclusion
from mainline-v6.3-rc1
commit 7c182722a0a9447e31f9645de4f311e5bc59b480
category: feature
bugzilla: 188933

Reference: https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/commit/?id=7c182722a0a9447e31f9645de4f311e5bc59b480

--------------------------------

Add a function nr_context_switches_cpu() that returns  number of context
switches since boot on the specified CPU.  This information will be used
to diagnose RCU CPU stalls.

Signed-off-by: Zhen Lei <thunder.leizhen@huawei.com>
